// spec: FUN-003
//
// ⚠️ A defect is a statement about the INTERPRETER and is never compiled.
//
// FUN-003 refuses 'Exit E;' inside a procedure, so this program must not run.
// The two words are interchangeable instead: the procedure returns 7 and the
// caller uses it.

procedure P ();
begin
    Exit 7;
end

WriteLn (P ());
